      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer by Hillel Zeitlin was published as “That We Be Reborn” with an English translation by Eugene Kohn in the <tei:hi rend="italic">Sabbath Prayer Book</tei:hi> (Jewish Reconstructionist Foundation 1945) of Rabbi Mordecai Kaplan. The prayer is undated and likely was published earlier and elsewhere. (I have provided the title for the prayer as it appears here at the Open Siddur Project, “תפילה להתחדש | A Prayer for Renewal/to be renewed.”) If you have more information on the original publication of this prayer, please contact us or leave a comment.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
